{
  "$schema": "../../../../schemas/security.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "A project is its owner's: ProjectActions.GetRowFilterAsync narrows every right below to the caller's own",
    "projects (an administrator sees all). New is not granted: the editor creates projects through /api/iconic,",
    "which applies the project quota (docs/iconic_PRD.md D21). Anonymous visitors get nothing from the model;",
    "they draw with a local draft and open shared links through /api/iconic/shared (D3, D20)."
  ],
